# Generated protobuf output is checked in on purpose: a published Rust crate
# must carry pre-generated .rs rather than force downstream consumers to install
# protoc, and the same reasoning keeps the TypeScript and Python artifacts here.
# Marking them generated collapses them in review and keeps them out of language
# statistics, so a contract change reads as the .proto diff it actually is.
gen/** linguist-generated=true
gen/** -diff
